From 18e51db55ee8181978e7835858ec9bff4239c07e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Instinct Builder (for Bambu)" <builder@instinct.local>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 02:15:51 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] CC2 probes: truthful-degradation envelope + 4 probe families
 + fixture tests (8/8)

Architect board 0006 section D: every panel reads {ok, observed_at, source,
latency_ms, error}; a failed probe is a failed card with error and age, never
an empty or green card. Pure parsers exported for fixture tests; fetchers wire
through the existing httpProbe at integration time.

Families: gateway /v1/districts (districts/action/question/stale/age_seconds),
foreman timer via the gateway board (last run/exit/next run; absent fields
degrade to null honestly - live field names unverified), factory latest run +
runner online/offline (read-only Actions API). Council graph stays truthful
not-wired (no status route in the canonical gateway).

Fixtures: factory-runs/runners RECORDED from the public GitHub API
2026-10-24 ~02:15 CST (runners total_count 0 is the real recorded state);
gateway payloads SYNTHETIC per the 0006 shape (no live /v1/districts payload
has ever been recorded; district labels remain hypothesis-only). Provenance in
fixtures/README.md. Local code + tests only - no deploy, no host changes.
