@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# CC2 probe fixtures
+
+Provenance, per fixture:
+
+- factory-runs-RECORDED.json - RECORDED 2026-10-24 ~02:15 CST from the public
+  GitHub Actions API (GET /repos/executiveusa/vibe-engineering/actions/runs?per_page=3).
+- factory-runners-RECORDED.json - RECORDED same time (GET .../actions/runners);
+  total_count 0 is the real recorded state (no self-hosted runners registered).
+- gateway-districts-SYNTHETIC.json - SYNTHETIC. Shape per architect board 0006
+  section D (districts, action, question, stale, age_seconds). No live
+  /v1/districts payload has ever been recorded; values are invented, shape is
+  the architect's. District labels remain hypothesis-only per the desk read.
+- gateway-board-foreman-SYNTHETIC.json - SYNTHETIC. Foreman timer fields read
+  through the gateway board per 0006 section D; exact live field names are
+  UNVERIFIED, so the parser degrades honestly when a field is absent.
